      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWEET MILLIE (8) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (17.18) at Healesville in a Grade 5. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. TIN LIDS (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing eighth (24.30) in a Grade 5 at Horsham. Has a good record at this journey. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has the ability to give this a shake. PRETTY PANAMA (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at Warragul in a handy 23.01 beating Athenian Goddess. Leading chance again. ZARI EXACT (3) has strong claims after a top-three finish last time out.",
